<title>USA: Dow skids after jobs report, purchasing data.</title>
<headline>Dow skids after jobs report, purchasing data.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Blue chip stocks plummeted on Friday as  investors reacted to reports on robust July employment and strong  activity from the nation's corporate purchasing managers.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average was down 100.11 at 8,122.50 at 10:18  a.m. (1418 GMT).</p>
</text>
